What a coincedance. I recently compiled NH3.1.2 on a NeXT, too!

Here's what I think the problem might be: in (I think) the file
config.h or unixconf.h, there's a line which asks you what
the HACKDIR is. This is the directory that the program searches
for 'perm' in. 'perm' is a 0K file which the game uses, I think,
to see if you have privs to play the game... I'm not positive on
this, tho... So you have to move at least perm, and probably
preferably everything, into the HACKDIR.

